# Script for camera_fov_min.toml / camera_fov_max.toml (see there).
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1100 press Return
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return
@gameplay+300 capture start
@gameplay+330 look 900 0
@gameplay+380 capture turned
@gameplay+400 look 0 -300
@gameplay+450 capture up
@gameplay+470 look 0 700
@gameplay+520 capture down
@gameplay+540 look 0 -400
@gameplay+600 log mark end
